API.md L7: the count of the entry-files finding is the number of files off the path, so a file that
holds two off-path entries counts once, and its first entry gives the path it belongs at.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- m/m.canon --
package m

record Item {
  power: Int = 1
}

@files("items/{id}.canon")
let items: table Item = {}
-- m/loose/a.canon --
package m

entry items.a { power: 2 }

entry items.b { power: 3 }
-- findings.txt --
warning[W0006]  m/m.canon:7:1
  1 entry files of items are off the path its @files template gives; first: m/loose/a.canon, which belongs at m/items/a.canon

0 errors, 1 warning in 1 package (…)
